WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:04,840
Well, good stuff can also relieve fatigue

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:07,590
Just get two kinds of vegetables

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:11,590
In the future, white flour, rice, vegetables, and fruits will all be available

4
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:32,350
Space can keep fresh

5
00:00:32,350 --> 00:00:34,950
No matter how you put it in, it will be the same when you take it out.

6
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:40,900
There are still most of the wild boars in the space

7
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:42,900
The remaining robes after processing

8
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,700
Rabbit and pheasant

9
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:46,800
And gold bars and munitions

10
00:00:46,800 --> 00:00:52,990
Gold bars and munitions cannot be touched

11
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:54,820
Save the cornmeal for eating

12
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:57,620
There is too much meat and we need to exchange money and goods as soon as possible

13
00:00:57,620 --> 00:00:59,020
Waiting to enter the city at night
